BreezeLab.jl

The initial ENA readers, forcing, surface fluxes, diagnostics, case assembly,
analysis scripts, and tests were adapted from Gregory L. Wagner's BreezyLASSO.jl:
https://github.com/glwagner/BreezyLASSO.jl
Source revision: 69ca861992cc51bea03ad7271f9bdd18263a1c34

BreezeLab introduces a separate package identity, explicit ENA protocol selection,
input validation, provenance for overrides, and bootstrap documentation/tests.
Scientific input data retain their upstream provenance; they are fetched separately.
